  "About Company": "Globe Civil Project is an integrated engineering, procurement, and construction (EPC) company. The company is engaged in infrastructure projects, like Transport and logistics projects, social and commercial projects, and non-infrastructure projects like commercial offices and housing.\nThe company has also diversified into specialized infrastructure and non-infrastructure projects like railway bridges, airport terminal, elevated railway terminal, and railway bridges and hospitals.\nAdditionally, the company also provides mechanical, electrical, and plumbing, architectural and structural work, etc\nIt is also a registered Class-1 Super contractor with the Central Public Work Department (“CPWD”), Government of India to tender for any work up to Rs 650 crore.",
